<title>USA: Kevco Inc Q3 pro forma net rises.</title>
<headline>Kevco Inc Q3 pro forma net rises.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH, Texas 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>						     Three Months Ended</p>
<p>							 September 30,</p>
<p>						  1996		   1995</p>
<p> Net sales				$ 69,449	     $ 62,714</p>
<p> Pro forma net income		    2,355		  1,326</p>
<p> Pro forma earnings per share	   0.46		   0.27</p>
<p>Weighted average shares outstanding</p>
<p>						 5,098		  4,946</p>
<p>							Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>							 September 30,</p>
<p>						 1996		    1995</p>
<p> Net sales				 205,048		119,015</p>
<p> Pro forma net income		    6,707		  2,603</p>
<p> Pro forma earnings per share	   1.32		   0.53</p>
<p>Weighted average shares outstanding</p>
<p>						 5,098		  4,946</p>
<p>NOTE: Pro forma net income and pro forma earnings per share for each period are presented as if the company had been a C corporation. The company converted from an S corporation to a C corporation upon its initial public offering on November 6, 1996.</p>
</text>
